laurel 2914: only the time stamp of the last finger event, for 2915's touch-to-panel number. The faster touch path (parked 2914-laurel-touch-rate) lost finger events on the phone (23:19).

diff --git a/bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c b/bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c
--- a/bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
